I just saw this dude eat a bagel that was about the size of a dog! And then he was eating it straight down his throat! How sick is that? Not even a little. And they're like, "Are you sure that's edible?" and he's like, "Yeah, that's all I can think of."
In regards to the other person's reaction, why do you think it's so hard to eat something when you're starving?
Yeah, they're like, "You're just not very full, aren't you, I can't even eat this much!" And this was the point of the post that I had written about when he told me what they're saying. Like, you're really fucking starving and they're like, "No we're hungry and you're a real good eating type of dude, you don't want to even know what's out of your bagel!" And, I'm like, "That's fine with me, you're a hungry animal, you just wanna feel it inside of you."

The sun rises, and casts its golden rays over the carnage and destruction that has been caused.
